  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "6656182",
      "title": "What Happens behind the Scenes on Structural Directives",
      "lectureOrder": 423,
      "videoOrder": 389,
      "sourceHash": "a1717999938604d8fd83a7fec30b3fa2a04a8a5cdbd4c21ed6470a3be1b2306b",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.64,
          "end": 4.08,
          "en": "-: So, now that we had a closer look",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.08,
          "end": 7.02,
          "en": "at attribute directives and created our own one,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.02,
          "end": 10.47,
          "en": "before creating our own structural directive,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.47,
          "end": 14.46,
          "en": "let me explain why this star is actually required.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.46,
          "end": 16.59,
          "en": "This star indicates to Angular",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.59,
          "end": 18.57,
          "en": "that this is a structural directive.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.57,
          "end": 21.51,
          "en": "The question is, why does it need to know?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.51,
          "end": 23.19,
          "en": "Because structural directives",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.19,
          "end": 26.55,
          "en": "with that star actually are just a nicer way",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 26.55,
          "end": 29.82,
          "en": "for us to to use them, basically.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 29.82,
          "end": 33.18,
          "en": "Behind the scenes, Angular will transform them",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 33.18,
          "end": 37.17,
          "en": "into something else, because there is no star",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 37.17,
          "end": 41.46,
          "en": "in Angular syntax when using, well, directives,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 41.46,
          "end": 44.4,
          "en": "or when using property binding or anything like that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 44.4,
          "end": 46.5,
          "en": "There is only property binding, event binding,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 46.5,
          "end": 49.02,
          "en": "two-way binding, and string interpolation,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 49.02,
          "end": 53.79,
          "en": "and there is no star operator or something like that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 53.79,
          "end": 55.02,
          "en": "So behind the scenes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 55.02,
          "end": 58.53,
          "en": "Angular needs to transform this NGF usage",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 58.53,
          "end": 61.71,
          "en": "into something where we end up with these tools,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 61.71,
          "end": 63.54,
          "en": "property binding and so on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 63.54,
          "end": 68.53999999999999,
          "en": "And it does; I can write the same list here differently.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 69.06,
          "end": 73.74,
          "en": "So if I try to write this only art block differently",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 73.74,
          "end": 76.28999999999999,
          "en": "I would end up with the following.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 76.28999999999999,
          "end": 80.97,
          "en": "I would have a ng-template element that is provided",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 80.97,
          "end": 84.33,
          "en": "by Angular as the NG indicates.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 84.33,
          "end": 88.62,
          "en": "And inside this element we have the content we",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 88.62,
          "end": 91.02,
          "en": "conditionally want to render.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 91.02,
          "end": 94.71000000000001,
          "en": "So, in this case here, we would have a div",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 94.71000000000001,
          "end": 97.833,
          "en": "inside of this and in this div, our list item.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 99.47999999999999,
          "end": 103.05,
          "en": "Now, you probably see that it's basically the same",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 103.05,
          "end": 105.36,
          "en": "but that it's wrapped an ng-template.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 105.36,
          "end": 108.45,
          "en": "The reason for this is that ng-template",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 108.45,
          "end": 111.27000000000001,
          "en": "is an element which itself is not rendered,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 111.27000000000001,
          "end": 114,
          "en": "but which allows us to define a template",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 114,
          "end": 116.61,
          "en": "in the end for Angular to use",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 116.61,
          "end": 119.4,
          "en": "once it determines that this template,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 119.4,
          "end": 121.14,
          "en": "some element, needs to be rendered,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 121.14,
          "end": 124.08,
          "en": "because this condition is true in this case.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 124.08,
          "end": 127.71,
          "en": "So on the ng-template, we place NGF",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 127.71,
          "end": 129.18,
          "en": "and now not with the star",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 129.18,
          "end": 132.6,
          "en": "because this is the form to which it will get transformed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 132.6,
          "end": 136.8,
          "en": "due to the star, but instead with the tool we already know,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 136.8,
          "end": 138.39,
          "en": "with property binding.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 138.39,
          "end": 141.72,
          "en": "And here we simply bind, well,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 141.72,
          "end": 145.5,
          "en": "not only odd, so the condition.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 145.5,
          "end": 148.32,
          "en": "So now we're back to the tools we know without the star",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 148.32,
          "end": 149.67000000000002,
          "en": "and that's why we have the star",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 149.67000000000002,
          "end": 154.07999999999998,
          "en": "because obviously that's the more intuitive syntax to use",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 154.07999999999998,
          "end": 155.22,
          "en": "directly placing it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 155.22,
          "end": 157.95,
          "en": "on the element we want to conditionally render.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 157.95,
          "end": 160.65,
          "en": "But that would be the real content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 160.65,
          "end": 163.68,
          "en": "behind the scenes to which it gets transformed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 163.68,
          "end": 165.21,
          "en": "Now you don't need to use that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 165.21,
          "end": 168.32999999999998,
          "en": "but I find it super important to be aware of this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 168.32999999999998,
          "end": 169.98,
          "en": "Now therefore, if we save this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 169.98,
          "end": 172.77,
          "en": "we see the list twice, and we see disappear",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 172.77,
          "end": 176.34,
          "en": "and appear twice, because it works exactly the same.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 176.34,
          "end": 179.52,
          "en": "It is exactly the same code behind the scenes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 179.52,
          "end": 182.523,
          "en": "This is what the star transforms it to.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
